design designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/c77/e78s/e78s-base.txt
# e78s: top + sides real (lever-held top row, sides fired by observers on TL's / TR's pullers at ~t3);
# bottom ideal: jf's asymmetric schedule (open A K B A B A, close A K B B) from d
